    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A plague born of ignorance is spreading in the shadows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanitism</strong> is a unique multiplayer online social deduction game. You will play as a member of a special investigation team, heading to the target location to complete assigned tasks within a limited time, work with your teammates to root out hidden threats and eliminate the growing disaster. Seek every possible means of survival\u2014collect randomly generated items, trade with in-world merchants, and adapt to the dangers of a constantly shifting environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong>: Up to 8 players can participate in intense and suspenseful online sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Playable Characters</strong>: Choose from a range of unique characters, each with their own distinct traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Items and Weapons</strong>: Every match features a different set of items and gear, procedurally generated for unpredictable gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Voice Chat</strong>: Communicate with your team in real time using the in-game voice chat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Identity System</strong>: A player's role may shift based on their actions\u2014<i><u>trust is a dangerous game.</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">And above all, keep your sanity.</span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A plague born of ignorance is spreading in the shadows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanitism</strong> is a unique multiplayer online social deduction game. You will play as a member of a special investigation team, heading to the target location to complete assigned tasks within a limited time, work with your teammates to root out hidden threats and eliminate the growing disaster. Seek every possible means of survival\u2014collect randomly generated items, trade with in-world merchants, and adapt to the dangers of a constantly shifting environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong>: Up to 8 players can participate in intense and suspenseful online sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Playable Characters</strong>: Choose from a range of unique characters, each with their own distinct traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Items and Weapons</strong>: Every match features a different set of items and gear, procedurally generated for unpredictable gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Voice Chat</strong>: Communicate with your team in real time using the in-game voice chat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Identity System</strong>: A player's role may shift based on their actions\u2014<i><u>trust is a dangerous game.</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">And above all, keep your sanity.</span></p>",
